<title>SPAIN: Spain's Dragados to build Uganda hospitals.</title>
<headline>Spain's Dragados to build Uganda hospitals.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ugandan health ministry awarded a 3.0 billion peseta construction contract to Spain's Dragados y Construcciones SA to build and equip three hospitals, Dragados said in a statement.</p>
<p>The African Development Bank will handle the financing.</p>
<p>Dragados shares were quoted five pesetas higher at 1,575 at 1145 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1  585 2151</p>
